</pre></details></article><article id="RH02" class="source-confirmed"><h2>RH02 · UnRedo_NameData / ReNameUnRedoOperation → 字符串快照与委托执行合同</h2><p>source-confirmed：UnRedo_NameData保存ModuleFullName/OldName/NewName三个string字段，不保存模块ID/GUID或模块对象。ReName操作构造保存RedoAction/UndoAction/Data，默认IsPart=true、IsDataComplete=true；Redo/Undo直接调用对应Action(Data,Params)，没有null门/catch/恢复逻辑，Update为空。Dispose清三个Action和Data，未清Params/ParentNode。</p><p>待追：外部修改Data/委托/优先级、Dispose后重用及Params/ParentNode引用生命期未知；该对象不是事务或稳定实体句柄。</p><details><summary>VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.UnRedo_NameData::.ctor · original-managed-cil</summary><pre>docs/architecture-recovery/workflow-rename-history-audit.cil.json:265–284
