</pre></details></article><article id="RH09" class="source-confirmed"><h2>RH09 · RootUnRedoOperation / Rename part Params → 优先级排序与RecoverStack是可用回调而非保证回滚</h2><p>source-confirmed：普通RootOperType分支Redo先Heigher再其它，Undo先Heigher逆序再其它逆序；另有CopyModule专用分支，本片不扩大其语义。BuildParams将dispatcher和recover表达式交每个part的新UnRedoParams。RecoverStack仅Pop来源并Push目标；改名part虽收到Params，SetOldName/SetNewName不读取、不调用recover，Rename Undo/Redo也无catch，因此不能说路径解析失败会自动把root搬回。Root执行循环一个Action抛错可跳过后续Action。</p><p>待追：完整Params合同、其它part何时执行recover、混合优先级/嵌套Group实际异常序列未知；不扩展其它历史操作闭环。</p><details><summary>VM.UnRedo.RootUnRedoOperation::Redo · original-managed-cil</summary><pre>docs/architecture-recovery/workflow-rename-history-audit.cil.json:17852–17871
